 *
 *   docs/json-schema-conformance.md        conformance, corpus pin, failures
 *   docs/guide/json-schema.md              the two front doors, the size table
 *   src/json-schema/keyword-map-*.ts       keyword -> bind / structural / unsupported
 *   src/json-schema/format-map.ts          the twenty format names
 *   config/plugin-catalog.lock.json        the plugin subpath names
 *
 * Every code block below was executed against src/ before it was written here.
 */

